/*
  Pagination.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0221 · Pagination (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface — the native peer of every routed literal in
  `components/ui/Pagination.tsx`. The native surface routes every string through the facade per the
  no-hardcoded-English rule.

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept
  in a per-surface table ("Pagination") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings. In test /
  preview bundles `NSLocalizedString` returns the value below, keeping the labels deterministic.

  Interpolation uses the i18next `{{token}}` shape (ported by PaginationInterpolation) so the translator sees
  the same tokens as the web source. The en dash (–, U+2013) in the "showing" summary is preserved
  verbatim from the web copy.
*/

